Ingredients are used to cook [[Dishes]] overnight in the izakaya, during the day as turn-ins for tasks, or to create dishes necessary to complete tasks. Each dish can have up to 5 ingredients. By adding extra ingredients to a dish, more properties can be added to better satisfy the needs of a customer.

